{"title": "Goaded (Condition)", "pageid": 5423, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Goaded_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has tick type", "Has status properties", "Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp/29px-Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp/44px-Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp/58px-Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Goaded Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp/29px-Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Goaded</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Must attack the goading creature, if possible.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Attack Rolls against targets other than the spellcaster. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GOADING_ATTACK</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CGOADING_ATTACK%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CGOADING_ATTACK%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Taunted\" title=\"SG Taunted\">SG_Taunted</a>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/LoseControl\" title=\"Status properties/LoseControl\">LoseControl</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/OverheadOnTurn\" title=\"Status properties/OverheadOnTurn\">OverheadOnTurn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/LoseControlFriendly\" title=\"Status properties/LoseControlFriendly\">LoseControlFriendly</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/25px-Warning_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/38px-Warning_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/71/Warning_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Warning Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/25px-Warning_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Warning_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <span style=\"color: #EB2C60;\">An affected party member is fully controlled by the game's AI, which may behave in unexpected ways.</span></li>\n<li>Goaded does not clear if the creature that inflicts it is killed. A goaded party member remains under the AI's control until it naturally expires.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Despite being stated that the goaded enemy will attack the caster, the enemy's AI does not change at all and may not prioritize attacking the goading creature if they leave the attacking range.</li>\n<li>The tooltip for this condition states it has a Wisdom save, but no such on-turn saving throw exists.</li>\n<li>A character under the effects of this condition has Disadvantage on <i>all</i> attack rolls, even against the source of the condition.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Goaded\">Sources of Goaded</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Goading_Blast\" title=\"Goading Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Goading_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Goading_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Goading_Blast_Icon.webp/45px-Goading_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Goading_Blast_Icon.webp/60px-Goading_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Goading Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Goading_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Goading_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Goading_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Goading_Blast\" title=\"Goading Blast\">Goading Blast</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Goading_Roar\" title=\"Goading Roar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Goading_Roar_Icon.webp/30px-Goading_Roar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Goading_Roar_Icon.webp/45px-Goading_Roar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Goading_Roar_Icon.webp/60px-Goading_Roar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Goading Roar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Goading_Roar_Icon.webp/30px-Goading_Roar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Goading_Roar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Goading_Roar\" title=\"Goading Roar\">Goading Roar</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Goading_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Goading Attack (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Goading_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Goading_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Goading_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/45px-Goading_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Goading_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Goading_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Goading Attack (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Goading_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Goading_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Goading_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Goading_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Goading Attack (Melee)\">Goading Attack (Melee)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Goading_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Goading Attack (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Goading_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Goading_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Goading_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/45px-Goading_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Goading_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/60px-Goading_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Goading Attack (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Goading_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Goading_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Goading_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Goading_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Goading Attack (Ranged)\">Goading Attack (Ranged)</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202325\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision